From: Pavel Khmelinsky <hmepas@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 20:12:22 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Recover WebSocket and root bootstrap after VPN reconnect

Cap WebSocket reconnect backoff at 15s, retry promptly on focus/online/visibilitychange, and probe apparently open sockets on resume so half-open connections close within 5s. Also treat transient 5xx/network failures during initial config/me/teams bootstrap as retryable instead of logging out or sticking on a blank Root div.
